OL,13,     FWordsworth B&B in Cockermouth,
OL,14,     FCumbria. At a spa visit, 'up for
OL,15,     Fanything' Dutchman Hans MacDaniel
OL,16,     Fis quick to volunteer for a spray
OL,17,     Ftan.
